id=thor-aynkey
name=Thor AYN button (aynkeyd)
version=v0.6.0
versionCode=600
author=local
description=Bind the AYN Thor's physical AYN button. Short press and long press each run /data/adb/thor-aynkey/action.sh, so the module is inert until an action is installed. The button is KEY_F24 on gpio-keys and nothing in LineageOS binds it; the daemon reads the evdev node as root because an app only receives key events while focused. The long action fires at 2000 ms without waiting for release. Keeps a bounded log at /data/adb/thor-aynkey/aynkeyd.log (aynkeyd log) because logcat on this device retains under six minutes; records which pipeline stage exited and on which signal. Reads one input node, writes no hardware node and no system property.
